      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding the LVT specifically, you mentioned the wear layer being a weak point. Is it common for that kind of damage to appear suddenly or randomly across the floor, or is it usually just in high-traffic paths? I'm just trying to get a sense of how unpredictable the surface degradation might be over time.",
